WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.913
Kemistri Dị n'Azụ Ngwaahịa Mmiri Mmiri. Nke a bụ nkebi 1 nke usoro ọmụmụ a.

2
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:16.856
Ngwa atọ na mbụ: surfactant nke na-arụ ọrụ ọ bụla, ka pH si arụ ọrụ, na otu esi egbochi nje.

3
00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:25.235
Lee bọket a. Anyị na-akpali surfactant, ya bụ ihe na-asa unyi ma na-eme ụfụfụ, n'ime mmiri, nwayọọ.

4
00:00:25.713 --> 00:00:31.181
Mkpụrụ surfactant ọ bụla nwere isi hụrụ mmiri n'anya na ọdụdụ hụrụ mmanụ n'anya.

5
00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:40.074
Ọdụdụ ndị ahụ na-agbakọ ghọọ obere bọọlụ a na-akpọ micelles. Unyi mmanụ na-abanye n'ime ha, mmiri ịsachapụ ebupụ ya.

6
00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:44.612
N'elu shelf a, e kewara ha site na chaj dị n'isi ha.

7
00:00:45.091 --> 00:00:57.863
Anionic dị ka SLES na-asa ma na-eme ụfụfụ. CAPB na-eme ka ha dị nro. Nonionic na-ebipụ unyi mmanụ. Cationic na-egbu nje, na-eme ka ntutu dị mma, ma na-eme ka akwa dị nro.

8
00:00:58.863 --> 00:01:07.286
Mmiri a na-acha ka mmiri ara ehi bụ fabric softener, ihe na-eme ka akwa dị nro, ngwaahịa cationic.

9
00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:19.672
Surfactant anionic na cationic na-adọta ibe ha ma kpụọ ihe na-arapara arapara nke anaghị arụ ọrụ ọ bụla n'ime ha abụọ.

10
00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:26.496
Ọ bụ ya mere softener ji aga na mmiri ịsachapụ, ọ bụghị ya na ihe ịsa akwa.

11
00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:40.912
Lee scale ka anyị na-akụnye SLES paste. Ọ na-adịkarị ihe dị ka pasentị 70 active, ya bụ ike n'ezie, ya mere 100 gram nwere ihe dị ka 70 gram ezi surfactant.

12
00:01:41.253 --> 00:01:50.340
CAPB na-adịkarị ihe dị ka pasentị 30 active. Gụọ data sheet nke onye na-ere gị mgbe niile, n'ihi na ọnụọgụ ahụ na-agbanwe.

13
00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:59.793
Lee ngụkọ Bisi. Active matter bụ pasentị ị na-eji mụbaa ike ya, wee gbakọta ha niile.

14
00:02:00.256 --> 00:02:07.541
Usoro ya dị pasentị 12.3 active, 615 gram ezi surfactant na 5 kilogram.

15
00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:21.170
Mgbe SLES ọhụrụ ya dị naanị pasentị 60 active, o jiri 875 gram kama 750 gram ka ike ya dị otu.

16
00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:36.712
Strip a na-agụ pH, ọnụọgụ na-egosi ma ihe ọ bụ acid ma ọ bụ alkaline, site na 0 ruo 14. Mmiri bụ 7. N'okpuru ya bụ acid, n'elu ya bụ alkaline, nzọụkwụ ọ bụla na-esi ike okpukpu iri.

17
00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:45.072
Tinye ya, chere oge e dere n'akpa ya, ma tụnyere agba ya n'ìhè ehihie. Nwalee tupu i tinye agba.

18
00:02:46.072 --> 00:02:51.147
Tupu i mee mmiri ọ bụla e ji edozi pH, yiri gloves na goggles.

19
00:02:51.533 --> 00:03:05.743
Tinye acid ma ọ bụ caustic nwayọọ n'ime mmiri, ọ dịghị mgbe mmiri n'elu ọgwụ ahụ, n'ihi na ọ nwere ike ikpo ọkụ ma gbasaa. Dee aha na karama ọ bụla e ji edozi pH.

20
00:03:06.743 --> 00:03:20.668
Amaka tụrụ ihe nlele 200 gram, pasentị 1 nke batch ya, ma tinye mmiri citric otu ntapụ otu ntapụ ruo mgbe ọ gụrụ pH 6. Nke ahụ were 0.9 gram.

21
00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:34.953
Mụbaa ya na 100, ọ bụrụ 90 gram. O buru ụzọ tinye 72 gram, nwalee, wee tinye nke fọdụrụ nwayọọ, ka ọ ghara ịgafe akara ọ chọrọ.

22
00:03:35.953 --> 00:03:42.631
Mgbe ị na-anwale ngwaahịa n'ụlọ, kewaa toilet cleaner na bleach, dị ka karama abụọ ndị a.

23
00:03:43.631 --> 00:03:56.567
Ncha mmiri mmiri bụ ọtụtụ mmiri, mmiri na-azụkwa nje. Ya mere jiri mmiri e meziri emezi, ma ọ bụ mmiri e siri esi ma kpuchie ya ka ọ jụọ oyi.

24
00:03:56.922 --> 00:04:07.463
Saa drum na osisi nkpali, saachapụ ha, hichaa ha na alcohol pasentị 70 ma hapụ ka ha kpọọ nkụ. Ejila ha mee nri ma ọlị.

25
00:04:08.463 --> 00:04:19.862
Preservative, ya bụ ihe na-egbochi nje, na-akwụsị nje na-abata ma e mechaa. Hauwa lere na pH ya dị n'ime ọnụ onye na-ere kwuru, wee tụọ 200 gram na scale digital.

26
00:04:20.304 --> 00:04:32.020
Tinye ya n'okpuru ihe dị ka 40 digrii Celsius, n'ihi na okpomọkụ nwere ike imebi ụfọdụ preservative. Zerekwa formalin: ọ bụ nsi.

27
00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:42.819
Ugbu a wụnye ya n'ime karama ọhụrụ ma ọ bụ nke e mere ka ọ dị ọcha, wee mechie ma tinye label ngwa ngwa.

28
00:04:43.819 --> 00:04:50.945
Debe karama abụọ site na batch ọ bụla, otu n'okpomọkụ ụlọ, otu n'ebe na-ekpo ọkụ.

29
00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:58.643
Lelee ha kwa izu ruo izu anọ, wee kwa ọnwa: isi, agba, ịdị ọcha, ọkpụrụkpụ, pH na ịza.

30
00:04:59.643 --> 00:05:12.876
Gụọ Safety Data Sheet nke ọgwụ ọ bụla. Yiri gloves nitrile na goggles, mee ka ikuku na-abata, ma debe karama mmiri dị ọcha maka ịsa anya gị nso, dị ka nke a.

31
00:05:13.876 --> 00:05:24.837
Ugbu a gụọ ihe ọmụmụ ndị dị n'okpuru. Mee ndepụta ihe eji arụ ọrụ gị, lelee pH nke ngwaahịa ise n'ụlọ, ma hazie akụkụ ọcha gị.

